 task buffer to a single episode, this setting closely resembles meta-testing (where context is
 drawn purely online), and we found this resampling strategy to work well in practice since
 it results in more relabelled transitions with non-zero reward. HTR using SER is outlined
 in Algorithm 3.4.
 3.4.3 Episode Clustering (EC) strategy
 An alternative strategy to Single Episode Resampling is to cluster trajectories that sat
isfied similar hindsight tasks into the same task buffers Bh, essentially creating additional
