 the developer. As such, support for functionality such as long term memory or multi-step
 reasoning that depends on state modifications between steps must be implemented on the
 client-side. The current stateless API layer overburdens developers with implementation of
 common, basic features for stateful LLM applications. It also requires state to be managed
